§§ `Aggravated burglary (s 10)`

`aggb firearm` MEANS `Aggravated burglary facts` WITH
    `the burglary` IS `burg building to steal`
    `at the time had with him a firearm, including an airgun or air pistol` IS TRUE
    `at the time had with him anything with the appearance of a firearm, whether or not capable of being discharged` IS FALSE
