§§ `Aggravated vehicle-taking (s 12A)`

`circ proven, no defence` MEANS `Vehicle-taking circumstance` WITH
    `the driving, accident or damage happened` IS TRUE
    `by then the vehicle had been unlawfully taken` IS TRUE
    `by then the vehicle had been recovered, that is restored to its owner or to other lawful possession or custody` IS FALSE
    `it happened before he committed the basic offence` IS FALSE
    `he was neither in nor on nor in the immediate vicinity of the vehicle when it happened` IS FALSE
