    `used electricity without due authority` IS FALSE
    `caused electricity to be wasted` IS TRUE
    `caused electricity to be diverted` IS FALSE
    `dishonest in dealing with the electricity` IS TRUE
`elec diverted` MEANS `Electricity facts` WITH
