§§ `Thefts from mails (s 14)`

`rob none` MEANS `Robbery facts` WITH
    `the stealing` IS `theft all`
    `used force on any person` IS FALSE
    `put or sought to put any person in fear of being then and there subjected to force` IS FALSE
    `immediately before or at the time of stealing` IS FALSE
    `in order to steal` IS FALSE
    `committed an assault with intent to rob` IS FALSE
